<title>UK: British Steel up, busy after German merger.</title>
<headline>British Steel up, busy after German merger.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Steel Plc was the most active UK stock by early afternoon on Thursday as Thyssen in Germany confirmed details of its steel merger with Krupp.</p>
</text>
